    "initialSymptom": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "this-was-not-a-gradual-warning-sign-failure",
          "title": "This was not a gradual warning-sign failure.",
          "description": "Unlike many engine failures that begin with knocks, rattles, overheating, or reduced power, this SDV6 crankshaft failure was instant and total: one moment normal motorway cruising, the next a bang, smoke, oil, and a dead engine.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/case-studies/assets/block-hole.png",
              "alt": "Range Rover SDV6 engine block with hole from snapped crankshaft - catastrophic engine failure",
              "width": "",
              "height": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Before"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "No warning lights"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "No prior EML, no power loss, and no unusual cold-start noise reported."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Failure"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Gunshot-like bang"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The crankshaft failed suddenly while cruising at motorway speed."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aftermath"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Oil on the road"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A holed block meant the engine was destroyed, not rebuildable."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "For SDV6 owners, catastrophic crankshaft failure can happen without an obvious warning noise. Preventative oil analysis may help, but this engine can still fail suddenly."
            },
            {
